  m_text: "You have 3 actions on your turn.\n\n\tMove: Move a ship from a tile to
    an adjacent tile.\n\tBuild: Add a ship to your home tile.\n\tBattle: (explained
    on next page)\n\tOrbital Shift: Rotate a ring around the sun\n\nAt the end of
    your turn, you may score one of the objectives above. This locks the objective
    from your opponent.\n\nYou win if you score 2 objectives."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6aa9b53a3245f7646974e26da640cc8d, type: 2}
